WEBVTT

00:18.770 --> 00:20.490
They all fell asleep?

00:35.280 --> 00:37.660
Tofu... onion...

00:38.390 --> 00:41.700
Shirataki noodle tsukumogami...

00:59.910 --> 01:07.670
<i>Malevolent Spirits</i>

02:20.990 --> 02:26.000
<b>Ambush</b>

02:27.010 --> 02:29.250
Didn't we come by here before?

02:29.250 --> 02:31.750
No. I think it's this way.

02:32.750 --> 02:35.070
I'm so confused.

02:35.070 --> 02:37.630
Well, you haven't lived in Kyoto long.

02:37.630 --> 02:39.580
Hey, is that it?

02:39.220 --> 02:41.470
<b>Tebata Fabrics</b>

02:40.970 --> 02:42.600
<b>Tebata Fabrics</b>

02:42.060 --> 02:45.220
I see I was right to ask you to join me.

02:45.580 --> 02:47.390
You're very welcome!

02:47.390 --> 02:49.350
I hope you can get a nice outfit made.

02:49.720 --> 02:50.700
Indeed.

02:50.700 --> 02:54.360
But I'm a bit nervous about the 
"test" mentioned in the catalog.

02:54.360 --> 02:57.860
<b>Kunato Hyoma-sama
\hc/o Nagatsuki Household</b>

02:54.360 --> 02:57.860
<b>Kyoto Saenome Mail-Order Catalog
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEnclosed</b>

02:54.860 --> 02:57.860
<b>Three Days Ago</b>

02:55.400 --> 02:57.860
Kyoto Saenome Mail-Order Catalog?

02:58.320 --> 02:59.370
And it's addressed to me?

02:59.370 --> 03:01.360
Oh, bet it's clothes.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.090
Clothes?

03:02.090 --> 03:06.120
Kyoto Saenome wear special 
equipment to fight tsukumogami.

03:07.430 --> 03:08.620
Now that you mention it,

03:09.040 --> 03:11.200
when Tsubaki was wreathed in flame earlier,

03:11.200 --> 03:12.960
her clothing remained unscathed.

03:13.340 --> 03:14.890
Hey, lemme see!

03:14.890 --> 03:18.330
I don't get to see Saenome 
mail-order stuff much.

03:22.970 --> 03:24.800
April Edition
Special Gift:
 Cute Sa-kun 
Desktop Calendar

03:22.970 --> 03:25.450
He models in his spare time, as well?

03:22.970 --> 03:26.850
An in-depth interview with Kadomori Taiju, Kyoto Saenome Head
The Clothing of My Fight
High defense and flexibility with lots of room for control talismans
Stylish and fashionable seals

